<title>CANADA: Ag Canada updates 1997/98 grain, oilseed S &amp; Ds.</title>
<headline>Ag Canada updates 1997/98 grain, oilseed S &amp; Ds.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Canada on Friday updated its 1997/98 (Aug/July) crop year forecast of grain and oilseed supply and disposition.</p>
